From c0f1a450d1f645a5346b15c6faa37c8bb4c83594 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lucas Cruz <jumpmasterguy@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 07:36:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] landing: stack the streaks/XP/referral cards on phones

The grid was hard-coded to repeat(3,1fr) with no mobile rule, so on a
390px screen each card was ~100px wide with one word per line. Switched to
the auto-fit pattern the rest of the page already uses.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015dQ5SbyDAUeUy9bHy8qS2Z
---
 client/public/landing.html | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/client/public/landing.html b/client/public/landing.html
index 0169dca..0a8523d 100644
--- a/client/public/landing.html
+++ b/client/public/landing.html
@@ -1088,7 +1088,7 @@
     <div style="text-align:center;color:var(--teal-mid);font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px">Built to stick, not just to finish</div>
     <h2 style="text-align:center;font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 14px;color:#fff">You won't forget you started this one.</h2>
     <p style="text-align:center;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.62);max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 48px;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6">Most training platforms are built to be finished once. Acqlerate is built to be opened daily — a streak that tracks your progress, a level that goes up as you learn, and a way to earn free Pro access just by sharing it.</p>
-    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px">
+    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:24px">
       <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:14px;padding:32px 24px;text-align:center">
         <div style="font-size:2.4rem;margin-bottom:10px">🔥</div>
         <div style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:6px">Daily Streaks</div>
